        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "獲物を　追い立てる　ために　水中から ジャンプして　大きな　水しぶきを　あげる。 群れで　ジャンプする　姿は　大迫力。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il a pour habitude de chasser en groupe. Sa large gueule lui permet d’engloutir un banc de Froussardine d’un seul coup.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Wailord pursue their prey in pods. With their large mouths, they can swallow entire schools of Wishiwashi whole.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "群れで　獲物を　追う　習性。 大きな　口で　ヨワシの　群れごと 一気に　呑み込んでしまうぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Sa taille fait de lui un Pokémon fascinant. Les sites touristiques proposant d’observer les Wailord ont toujours beaucoup de succès.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its immense size is the reason for its popularity. Wailord watching is a favorite sightseeing activity in various parts of the world.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "とにかく　どでかいので　人気。 ホエルオーウォッチングは　各地で 人気の　観光プラン　なのだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les Wailord se sont multipliés à force de se gaver de Pokémon poissons, tant et si bien que les pêcheurs doivent les renvoyer vers le large.",
